  "limitations": [
    "Single exploratory fit per case, no controlled warm repeated timing or production implementation.",
    "Original ill41, ill41-long, ill83-long, early120 and rank41 scoring used float64 host addition rather than explicitly representing update in float32; see represented/history reruns.",
