    "Each JSON source_before/source_after records in-run live-library and experiment hashes; archive hashes below reflect files as saved, not a replacement for in-run checks.",
    "Candidate line-search alpha was selected offline using independent scores; its selection and independent float64 objective/gradient scoring time are not included.",
    "Pilot CG matrix-vector products are extra inner work beyond reported accepted optimizer steps; no production total-budget accounting or stopping criterion was implemented.",
    "The rank fixture checks one exact pairwise dependency, not general float32 row-space preservation.",
    "Device correction in the scratch pilot uses high-level MLX but the experiment loads NumPy and sklearn to generate and score reference data."
